    This report presents data on the population characteristics, literacy, educational attainment, migration,
    services to the people of Afghanistan.
    Security remains a challenge in Kapisa, as in much of the country. For this reason, Tagab and
    Alasay districts were not covered and their population characteristics are not available in this report.
    Nevertheless, important indicators at the province level may be estimated.

